      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warrior_Run%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Warrior Run Mining Company reopened the old Holland and Hillman mine in 1864, building a breaker that opened in 1867.",
